<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="AOVSS" id="AOVSS" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7e485fd6" id="u7e485fd6">📡</span><span data-lake-id="u9570e891" id="u9570e891"> 𝐐𝐮𝐚𝐑𝐨𝐭: 𝐎𝐮𝐭𝐥𝐢𝐞𝐫-𝐅𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝟒-𝐁𝐢𝐭 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐢𝐧 𝐑𝐨𝐭𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐋𝐋𝐌𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uad62997d" id="uad62997d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uecb86615" id="uecb86615">大语言模型因其广泛的应用而变得日益重要。然而，在实际应用中使用这些模型，即进行推理，需要消耗大量的计算、内存和能源资源，尤其是在预填充阶段，模型需要处理较长的提示，并在各层缓存相应信息</span></strong></p><ul list="ud9db78e2"><li fid="u03afc2b7" data-lake-id="u9ca5515c" id="u9ca5515c"><span data-lake-id="uef7b2589" id="uef7b2589">量化通过在前向传播过程中使用较低精度的数据类型，成为缓解内存与计算开销问题的最重要技术之一</span></li><li fid="u03afc2b7" data-lake-id="uc0a20da9" id="uc0a20da9"><span data-lake-id="u43e35d02" id="u43e35d02">由于预填充阶段受计算能力限制（compute-bound），联合量化旨在降低参数和 KV 缓存的精度，以减少内存占用，同时降低输入（即激活）的精度，从而以低精度执行前向传播。然而，激活中存在数值远大于其他元素的离群值，使得激活量化比权重量化更加困难，尤其是在 4 位量化的情况下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue42178ba" id="ue42178ba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7be5ecb1" id="u7be5ecb1">本文通过随机化 Hadamard（哈达玛）变换对模型输入进行旋转，以解决离群特征问题。利用计算不变性这一思想，将 Hadamard 变换融合到权重矩阵中，从而得到一个不含离群特征的等价网络。这使得权重、激活和 KV 缓存均能够被量化为 4 位，而仅产生极小的精度下降。主要贡献如下</span></strong></p><ul list="u84b84bce"><li fid="u7891f6cd" data-lake-id="u4208edcf" id="u4208edcf"><span data-lake-id="uff5a0717" id="uff5a0717">无需对模型进行额外修改，即可将随机化 Hadamard 变换应用于权重矩阵。可以在不改变模型输出的前提下，消除离群特征，使激活更易于量化</span></li><li fid="u7891f6cd" data-lake-id="ufaf95b2a" id="ufaf95b2a"><span data-lake-id="uce83f18b" id="uce83f18b">将这一方法进一步扩展到注意力模块，通过在线 Hadamard 变换消除键和值中的离群特征，从而实现 KV 缓存的量化</span></li><li fid="u7891f6cd" data-lake-id="u8782471d" id="u8782471d"><span data-lake-id="ub4a641b1" id="ub4a641b1">基于上述修改，QuaRot 采用整数量化，将全部权重、激活和 KV 缓存量化为 4 位，从而实现大语言模型的 4 位推理</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="jrWV1" id="jrWV1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7214ae2e" id="u7214ae2e">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u9754a75b" id="u9754a75b"> 𝐁𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐠𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐧𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ucd9b13da" id="ucd9b13da"><strong><span data-lake-id="u47f046d3" id="u47f046d3">正交矩阵、旋转矩阵与 Hadamard 矩阵：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uedf64e9a" id="uedf64e9a">正交矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2f26cc65e9b309efa11c948e05cf2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qgxlh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b21c3b2" id="u6b21c3b2">是满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fb0d2d4e78a0d3ab8c8bef83ee6b336.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OYKG9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81e1c1ed" id="u81e1c1ed">的方阵。旋转矩阵是一种正交矩阵。Hadamard 矩阵是元素取自</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%2B1%2C-1%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F860fd499c7a67acfe8cc1bea42591af7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RWsaR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u65806015" id="u65806015">的正交矩阵。Walsh–Hadamard 矩阵是阶数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%3D2%5En%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F25cf54c831863def6c01f01fac637e39.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HJPD4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03774fe4" id="u03774fe4">的方阵，满足</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2a851e57" id="u2a851e57" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_2%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%7D%7D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bbmatrix%7D1%261%5C%5C%5C%5C1%26-1%5C%5Cend%7Bbmatrix%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%5En%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_2%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%5E%7Bn-1%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F36e093d8b4b6e2fe7515716be2e18e27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SegGz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue64e5155"><li fid="u673aee86" data-lake-id="ude10e921" id="ude10e921"><span data-lake-id="u11398e8f" id="u11398e8f">Walsh–Hadamard 变换能够以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(d%5C%5Clog_2(d))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b991e7e89646c6d297fb9909779f9b3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yavng%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8569ab6d" id="u8569ab6d">的运算复杂度计算矩阵与向量的乘积</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04306b7f5ee47c1414a762c1de9c7b21.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iR5Nc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf0515a40" id="uf0515a40">​</span></li><li fid="u673aee86" data-lake-id="uf5019f90" id="uf5019f90"><span data-lake-id="u1bc60576" id="u1bc60576">当矩阵阶数不是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5En%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F055ce37910d06a8239ef5a1ee87765f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WK1ua%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udcd4c8ab" id="udcd4c8ab">时，不能保证存在相应的 Hadamard 矩阵。当需要阶数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cneq2%5En%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe30d5f090248275a039118616fcaa41d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cDJYA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c3e7152" id="u4c3e7152">的 Hadamard 矩阵时，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y4KkQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f93d575" id="u9f93d575">分解为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%3D2%5En%20m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F250596e4ef76ac5d2afe808ffd2674ee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iBzrZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u305e56ed" id="u305e56ed">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Prbct%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8270539d" id="u8270539d">是某个已知 Hadamard 矩阵的阶数。随后，采用 Kronecker 积构造</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_d%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B2%5En%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd8e4ea8a6ab2d43cfc96fdb428cb9456.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cEvPN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u087184a2" id="u087184a2">。即可用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(d(m%2Bn))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F782cf588e0ba203c378e4cd70bb439e5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LZFOy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud81395d4" id="ud81395d4">次运算计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94452e9ea94be48a00cd2b3bc8b69e5e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JMN2Q%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03c43ac0" id="u03c43ac0">​</span></li><li fid="u673aee86" data-lake-id="u1d9cd0ee" id="u1d9cd0ee"><span data-lake-id="u64025d12" id="u64025d12">遵循 Tseng et al. 的方法，使用随机化 Hadamard 矩阵。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F179e18f6068c380fef549b85baa6db7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TQb1X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc3c7bd91" id="uc3c7bd91">是一个由从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%2B1%2C-1%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F860fd499c7a67acfe8cc1bea42591af7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SWyJB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7940df1" id="ub7940df1">中随机采样的元素构成的向量，并令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff816e4fd0228005bb1bf1d657c11e1ff.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lWYYu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u14eaeed9" id="u14eaeed9">。容易看出，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6515913b4fba33bfe4fbd38c3a9f32da.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GOqZN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cb32bc0" id="u1cb32bc0"> 同样是正交矩阵</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue0b284e2" id="ue0b284e2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5dcdaab4" id="u5dcdaab4">非相干性处理（incoherence processing）的思想由 Chee et al. 在面向大语言模型的仅权重量化研究中提出，用于权重归一化。如果权重矩阵</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdc10020247da5f8307363dbc8d72fdc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Xljil%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u25995f23" id="u25995f23">满足以下条件，则称其具有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F756a643380ff53c0692dbc2e7e930a35.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s5SYE%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u33ebdaf1" id="u33ebdaf1">-非相干性</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9922793d" id="u9922793d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmax(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D)%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmu%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%5C%5C%7C_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BF%7D%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bmn%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff1821b77906ff6334a5553e8596f55a8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pNUxP%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u07908c24"><li fid="u50b304fe" data-lake-id="u29504b1c" id="u29504b1c"><span data-lake-id="u7aa5d8a6" id="u7aa5d8a6">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmax%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4cecb7fabfe052a053fb37d3f434cc12.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gu5pT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a61ab77" id="u8a61ab77">表示矩阵所有元素中的最大值，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22mn%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae6f21fdd16d6d2b8f70b10dc0c373cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Po7aa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8204ba88" id="u8204ba88">表示矩阵的元素总数。具有较高非相干性的权重矩阵难以量化：相对于元素的平均幅值，其最大元素是一个离群值。在权重矩阵的左侧和右侧乘以正交矩阵，可以降低其非相干性，使矩阵更易于量化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1dd2600e" id="u1dd2600e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u40b534db" id="u40b534db">计算不变性定理指出，可以使用正交矩阵对 Transformer 中的权重和模块间激活进行变换，而不改变模型输出</span></strong></p><ul list="uffb9590e"><li fid="u4c88fcc8" data-lake-id="uc9ab5f94" id="uc9ab5f94"><span data-lake-id="ue4f0836e" id="ue4f0836e">如果</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bin%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8407a3f51b6c98c9e069025f4c1dcd75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Du2Oz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u010a65ca" id="u010a65ca">是位于 Transformer 模块左侧的权重矩阵，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bgate%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2facbef8fdbf4a2e6ea07a9079ef937a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HUlh2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8868184" id="uf8868184">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bup%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8ba8943d70d67ebc84bfd9cdeff70e3f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z2gG8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6aa621f" id="ua6aa621f">，或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6af7c395f82690722e9bbab59e6fa19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fxKSS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7fa4532b" id="u7fa4532b">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bq%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F555b97f3917dc033828dc38c5b0b2f7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OpsUD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33be4373" id="u33be4373">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a27c42f2651505c6f878984abfe54a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22drfFs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u045a115d" id="u045a115d">，那么可以在其左侧乘以正交矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2f26cc65e9b309efa11c948e05cf2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22H2JHG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21bcf12c" id="u21bcf12c">，并通过将输出矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdown%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40d92b2a0f09917bd81baad5c8e6a9d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UfOjq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8259700" id="ua8259700">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb3e03e1401eebf7beb612b74d1f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LU9K1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f8ff274" id="u5f8ff274">右乘</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b130d384487608370a42341293ecb1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MYIFu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a37317e" id="u9a37317e">来抵消这一变换的影响</span></li><li fid="u4c88fcc8" data-lake-id="u5129b18d" id="u5129b18d"><span data-lake-id="ud2b0c2e8" id="ud2b0c2e8">即使两个模块之间存在 RMSNorm 操作，上述性质仍然成立，前提是 RMSNorm 模块中不执行重新缩放。在实际实现中，首先将所有重新缩放操作吸收到相邻的权重矩阵中。从概念上看，这是因为 RMSNorm 将激活除以其范数，而对激活施加旋转</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2f26cc65e9b309efa11c948e05cf2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yrITr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c014906" id="u2c014906">并不会改变其范数。因此，存在以下交换关系</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u447353cd" id="u447353cd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffd3e9b7c3276ed1c71e651f691ac717c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ybTG0%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u86513981"><li fid="ub18fdcf4" data-lake-id="ufcc20abf" id="ufcc20abf"><span data-lake-id="u7f7195fc" id="u7f7195fc">将输出矩阵右乘</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b130d384487608370a42341293ecb1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YkEom%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5533964" id="ud5533964">后，该线性层的输出变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4689d78eb349a08c6c5d1084c0ac19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AHccW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f0ac318" id="u4f0ac318">。这一输出经过归一化后，被传入下一个模块；由于该模块的输入权重矩阵已变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd8c8b3088da66531ad177f629a50cfd6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zVyar%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua221ce42" id="ua221ce42">，因此，该线性层仍然输出原始的激活结果，不发生改变</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue5f8a1c4" id="ue5f8a1c4"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791287791385-554efbe1-3da1-4cfd-96c5-6d8a01540609.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub4793b3d-b41a-4d4a-ade6-5e7070b8046%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u59d8573c-6729-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A664%2C%22height%22%3A276%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A22796%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A830%2C%22originHeight%22%3A345%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A127%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DIAGQ%22%2C%22x%22%3A187%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FFN%22%2C%22x%22%3A504%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DOWN%22%2C%22x%22%3A671%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YGATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A386%2C%22y%22%3A94%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A93%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A508%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A10%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P%22%2C%22x%22%3A391%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22111%22%2C%22x%22%3A172%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f8%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7046a667%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub8394234" id="ub8394234"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791287814989-b07da88f-56c0-4844-b99a-4a58ee2c8d0d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6424ae85-6d41-4bc3-8f41-5948619a512%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u59d8573c-6729-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A911.2%2C%22height%22%3A364%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A40004%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1139%2C%22originHeight%22%3A455%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22RMSNORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A144%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A119%2C%22y%22%3A157%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-HEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A721%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KV-CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A721%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A721%2C%22y%22%3A119%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IAGO%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A563%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WK%22%2C%22x%22%3A433%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OT%22%2C%22x%22%3A964%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A101%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u7f9ccc76%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="dlDij" id="dlDij" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u91805daa" id="u91805daa">⛵ 𝐌𝐞𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐝</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc966fe36" id="uc966fe36"><span data-lake-id="uc4f8fc38" id="uc4f8fc38">QuaRot 包含两个阶段。在第一阶段，以全精度对模型权重进行变换，并在模型的前向传播过程中插入两个额外的 Hadamard 操作。在第二阶段，使用现有方法量化权重，并在前向传播过程中加入量化操作，以实现激活及缓存的在线量化。默认情况下，使用 GPTQ 进行权重量化，而激活则采用简单的就近舍入方案进行即时量化</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7f2598a7" id="u7f2598a7"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791288122704-1f3f5fb3-a416-4564-917f-1f6a928094f9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud88b3f4a-fbfd-4e55-88f3-b76de9ad76d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2ed5d569-241f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A830.4%2C%22height%22%3A296%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A43977%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1038%2C%22originHeight%22%3A370%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A109%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%BF1%22%2C%22x%22%3A207%2C%22y%22%3A165%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A82%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A705%2C%22y%22%3A154%2C%22width%22%3A18%2C%22height%22%3A85%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NT4I%22%2C%22x%22%3A243%2C%22y%22%3A191%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22