2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A536%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATTENTION%22%2C%22x%22%3A765%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP16%22%2C%22x%22%3A534%2C%22y%22%3A408%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP16%22%2C%22x%22%3A476%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Q(W.%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A720%2C%22y%22%3A342%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A86%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A224%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A19%2C%22height%22%3A67%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1038%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YQ%22%2C%22x%22%3A1246%2C%22y%22%3A296%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P16%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A239%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A781%2C%22y%22%3A455%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A257%2C%22y%22%3A257%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP16%22%2C%22x%22%3A1247%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B0%8FNT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1113%2C%22y%22%3A223%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A398%2C%22y%22%3A196%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22INT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A425%2C%22y%22%3A346%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NT4%22%2C%22x%22%3A389%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%228Q%22%2C%22x%22%3A25%2C%22y%22%3A271%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FP16%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A123%2C%22y%22%3A276%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%80-%22%2C%22x%22%3A550%2C%22y%22%3A390%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u71d492c8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u73ef24f4" id="u73ef24f4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u13e7488a" id="u13e7488a">权重修改：首先利用计算不变性，将各个权重矩阵与正交矩阵相乘。先将 LayerNorm 或 RMSNorm 中的线性部分融合到相邻的权重矩阵中</span></strong></p><ul list="u874ce7ac"><li fid="u388fa6fe" data-lake-id="ud2a17252" id="ud2a17252"><span data-lake-id="u15d0dc12" id="u15d0dc12">移除 RMSNorm 中的缩放操作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc0903496b51257470bc54b7019edf8c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rrrp8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32dfd6aa" id="u32dfd6aa">，并将其吸收到后续的权重矩阵中</span></li><li fid="u388fa6fe" data-lake-id="u8cc67090" id="u8cc67090"><span data-lake-id="ufbe34c14" id="ufbe34c14">选择一个阶数与模型隐藏维度相匹配的随机化 Hadamard 矩阵，并将其左乘或右乘到各个权重矩阵上。例如，键投影的权重矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6af7c395f82690722e9bbab59e6fa19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lfPOf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf810260" id="ucf810260">修改为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9a9e4c75" id="u9a9e4c75" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bdiag%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0653650df9e131571f82e585b496a72.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dvv78%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u581f299b"><li fid="u1662c147" data-lake-id="u628b23b4" id="u628b23b4"><span data-lake-id="u9f2186cc" id="u9f2186cc">其他权重矩阵采用类似的处理方式。位于模块输出侧的矩阵则右乘 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2f26cc65e9b309efa11c948e05cf2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h7Nmu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9f8828f" id="ua9f8828f">。根据计算不变性定理，在数值精度足够的前提下，上述权重修改不会影响模型输出。此外，Transformer 模块之间传递的激活矩阵也经过非相干性处理，变为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa27da7e0081b263fc6517c78711a4722.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hWLRz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9dc9c77" id="ue9dc9c77">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1af737af" id="u1af737af"><strong><span data-lake-id="u929e1535" id="u929e1535">旋转前馈网络中的激活：完成上述权重修改后，许多权重矩阵的一侧已经乘上 Hadamard 矩阵，相应的激活也发生变化。还需要改善各模块内部激活的量化效果，通过插入在线 Hadamard 操作来实现这一目标</span></strong></p><ul list="u3c18f760"><li fid="ud7fe641d" data-lake-id="ucb909ef0" id="ucb909ef0"><span data-lake-id="ue159464d" id="ue159464d">在前馈网络的下投影矩阵之前插入一个 Hadamard 操作。该操作以全精度执行，并采用遵循 Tseng et al. 的高效计算内核实现。通过将 Hadamard 矩阵融合到网络的下投影矩阵中，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdown%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdown%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51765032c0683c03d90bf931aaadc900.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CqXEs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf64198df" id="uf64198df">，可以隐式抵消这一操作的影响。结合全局矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2f26cc65e9b309efa11c948e05cf2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KXs61%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u21251462" id="u21251462">，下投影矩阵最终变为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdown%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9349dc5de0875df13c4604f44f288eea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RRoUz%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6f61f5de" id="u6f61f5de"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea621b3a" id="uea621b3a">注意力中的值投影：为每个注意力模块应用一个额外的 Hadamard 操作。这一修改的一部分在线执行，另一部分则融合到权重矩阵中</span></strong></p><ul list="uc6af12e4"><li fid="uacf7ed78" data-lake-id="u5b630ccf" id="u5b630ccf"><span data-lake-id="uf85b8c61" id="uf85b8c61">首先注意，在注意力计算中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a27c42f2651505c6f878984abfe54a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZWIMw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufede8730" id="ufede8730">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb3e03e1401eebf7beb612b74d1f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kDqYK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u009a4643" id="u009a4643">在每个注意力头内部隐式相乘。将注意力计算写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc1d1953e" id="uc1d1953e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bconcat%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_1%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_1)%5C%5Ccdots(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_%7Bn_h%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_%7Bn_h%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F195de980670626087d93e781e79e34cc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T0gu9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud0792576" id="ud0792576" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BY%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bh%3D1%7D%5E%7BH%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_h%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19f1fcaec591761fb38ee38322ea5eab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22epNaC%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u83bad795"><li fid="u97324b85" data-lake-id="ucb96b109" id="ucb96b109"><span data-lake-id="u3ce6eb51" id="u3ce6eb51">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbc2c6e702a759571d47249bfae6f79f4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AS1Yp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8ea41001" id="u8ea41001">是一个阶数等于序列长度的方阵，由对键和值进行 softmax 计算得到；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BV%7D_h%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f1b9c9bd7d0d1d1d29bfc909ae7a0fe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sDJvl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua4de270d" id="ua4de270d">是单个注意力头的值矩阵。这使能够使用阶数与每个注意力头维度相匹配的 Hadamard 矩阵</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0766c8a5912328a050203e65f0f1a4c2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CO5d2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uede76a88" id="uede76a88">，对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a27c42f2651505c6f878984abfe54a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uFzmO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua232970a" id="ua232970a">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb3e03e1401eebf7beb612b74d1f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j3Ifs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c706a0f" id="u6c706a0f">进行额外处理</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub4c713ed" id="ub4c713ed" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%5E%7B(h)%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc88abaf31d90e5742818141257b33860.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WIo5C%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u43eae611"><li fid="u7ccf07c4" data-lake-id="u4066419e" id="u4066419e"><span data-lake-id="u3fa3fe37" id="u3fa3fe37">将这些修改代入式（6），注意力的计算结果保持不变。由于各注意力头的权重在权重表示中以拼接方式组织，因此，可以等价地执行一次具有 Kronecker 结构的乘法</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueede7d74" id="ueede7d74" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D.%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff89a95d27aceb3a350acf947e2fc49ea.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Nv8km%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf3700492"><li fid="u92324a7b" data-lake-id="u637efad5" id="u637efad5"><span data-lake-id="u9759416c" id="u9759416c">至此，这一变换已经逐头应用于权重矩阵，使得多头注意力模块输出的激活也分别在各头内部发生旋转。为对注意力激活完成一次完整的 Hadamard 操作，使变换进一步跨越不同注意力头，利用以下恒等式：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2864a286" id="u2864a286" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bn_h%5C%5Ctimes%20d_h%7D%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bn_h%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fae7bc4875cefb8facb10da57d8064061.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DWdYI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7153d671"><li fid="u4dc3de71" data-lake-id="u14cb13ce" id="u14cb13ce"><span data-lake-id="u64540012" id="u64540012">当注意力头数量 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0c3e4ad6127db0eaa2934769e2098781.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RgQP0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u833f6d23" id="u833f6d23"> 和每个头的维度 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9a51260b8293a322049a4a40cc888982.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DjZol%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7381ccae" id="u7381ccae"> 均为 2 的幂时，该恒等式成立。由于已经将 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe381b3c541f01da7db4b87d479099c86.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ppSCa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6a5c7521" id="u6a5c7521"> 应用于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a27c42f2651505c6f878984abfe54a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Uyxyi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a63f22a" id="u1a63f22a"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb3e03e1401eebf7beb612b74d1f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22akeRv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud30f5aed" id="ud30f5aed">，因此，只需进一步将 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86b4b514e806bd95c9daa35fd5e9063c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jglOi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8653733b" id="u8653733b"> 应用于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb3e03e1401eebf7beb612b74d1f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yYgra%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u62894e57" id="u62894e57">，即可完成整体变换 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6af4ab95c059661743b24fc8ff5926ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ui3wl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub23cb524" id="ub23cb524">。同时，在前向传播中插入一个模块，计算 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bn_h%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fadc35e35ea0e9deed522dc54158e6819.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JbSZP%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64cce6cb" id="u64cce6cb">，其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BZ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d06f8e675646c1e1564fed2133dafde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l0OQg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf4ba0b9" id="ucf4ba0b9"> 为注意力激活</span></li><li fid="u4dc3de71" data-lake-id="u0a0d109d" id="u0a0d109d"><span data-lake-id="ue7b8cb50" id="ue7b8cb50">通过重塑张量以处理 Kronecker 结构，再对重塑后的数据执行 Walsh–Hadamard 变换，即可高效完成这一计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3a604034" id="u3a604034"><span data-lake-id="udd52630b" id="udd52630b">键旋转：利用上述方法，可以有效量化值向量。然而，注意力模块中的键向量同样存在离群值问题。与前面的处理类似，可以使用 Hadamard 旋转缓解这一问题，从而实现 KV 缓存的完整量化</span></p><ul list="u88786ae9"><li fid="uc47309cc" data-lake-id="ubbc12493" id="ubbc12493"><span data-lake-id="uf7a5289e" id="uf7a5289e">首先注意，注意力分数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbf733a46195f87c78518970457aebbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22znyPY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09ae1ac1" id="u09ae1ac1">的计算方式如下</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufe35e976" id="ufe35e976" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bq%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bconcat%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_1)%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7Bn_h%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F097153bba11d30056b909c82688f5833.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vpciv%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uac12aee4" id="uac12aee4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bconcat%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_1)%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7Bn_h%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd9c9fd0b7df3df730dccf75dddf9d1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dGEPZ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucae416a7" id="ucae416a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_h%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Calpha%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_h)%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_h%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D)%5C%5Codot%5C%5Cmathbf%7BM%7D%5C%5Cright).%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d814435116cf699ad58dfde16d12f4b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ak9GX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u827274b2"><li fid="u84413cc8" data-lake-id="ub497ac23" id="ub497ac23"><span data-lake-id="u03d2ea06" id="u03d2ea06">现在可以观察到，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2f26cc65e9b309efa11c948e05cf2e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z49If%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1676dba" id="ue1676dba"> 与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbd2339328b7567cf8beb0c5239de4f5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s2cAR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbfea9a3" id="ucbfea9a3"> 之间存在与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bv%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4a27c42f2651505c6f878984abfe54a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wjUFM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7b935515" id="u7b935515"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe2ccb3e03e1401eebf7beb612b74d1f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Kz2TO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u70d8c713" id="u70d8c713"> 之间类似的相互作用。然而，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a387a00408fb62a2633654397d028cd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XGN7m%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u709a0622" id="u709a0622"> 的存在，使无法直接将 Hadamard 矩阵融合到 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bq%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F555b97f3917dc033828dc38c5b0b2f7c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yoPxc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6932726f" id="u6932726f"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6af7c395f82690722e9bbab59e6fa19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xR3rB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c362213" id="u4c362213"> 中。因此，采用在线逐头 Hadamard 旋转，同时旋转查询和键。相应地，查询矩阵和键矩阵的计算修改为：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0780eef3" id="u0780eef3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bq%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bconcat%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_1)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BQ%7D_%7Bn_h%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd27e74fdf44c8492b0edc572bac44931.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k1dZO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubc0f895f" id="ubc0f895f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BX%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bk%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5C%5Cotimes%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bconcat%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_1)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPos%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BK%7D_%7Bn_h%7D)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7Bd_h%7D%5C%5Cright%5D.%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3f7c7278758acb36dce6ec5abb29af94.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oWGs1%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5e7d8eac"><li fid="uf225a9bf" data-lake-id="u295d36fa" id="u295d36fa"><span data-lake-id="uc7a9bedc" id="uc7a9bedc">由于查询和键均进行旋转，最终的注意力分数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BP%7D_h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbbf733a46195f87c78518970457aebbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pXeMO%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8191835c" id="u8191835c"> 保持不变。考虑到解码时只有一个查询向量，却存在大量已缓存的键向量，采用 Post-RoPE 缓存。这样，每个解码步骤只需对单个词元执行 Hadamard 变换。上述对前向传播的修改，包括插入专门的 Hadamard 模块以及调整权重，都不会改变模型前向计算的结果。其作用在于：模块之间的激活乘上 Hadamard 矩阵，而模块内部的激活则通过在线 Hadamard 变换进行处理，并由相应的权重矩阵修改抵消这些变换的影响。至此，即可对权重和激活进行量化</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="hjOXM" id="hjOXM"><span data-lake-id="uc31f9d8d" id="uc31f9d8d">阶段 2a：权重量化</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u42861b83" id="u42861b83"><span data-lake-id="u466d6763" id="u466d6763">使用 GPTQ [Frantar et al., 2022] 对网络权重进行量化。需要指出的是，在完成上述前向传播修改后，可以应用任意量化方法。在后续章节中，将表明，也可以使用简单的就近舍入（Round-to-Nearest，RTN）方案替代 GPTQ，但会付出一定的精度代价。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="aa6xA" id="aa6xA"><span data-lake-id="ud6349325" id="ud6349325">阶段 2b：在线量化操作</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u811032f0" id="u811032f0"><span data-lake-id="u7b10cf96" id="u7b10cf96">完成权重量化后，接下来在前向传播中加入对激活进行量化的操作。遵循 PyTorch 的实现，将不含缩放操作的 RMSNorm 计算保留为 FP32。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue49ef088" id="ue49ef088"><span data-lake-id="u0e262327" id="u0e262327">对于线性层的输入，采用逐词元对称量化，即按输入矩阵的行进行量化。在对称量化过程中，将每个词元对应向量的最大绝对值除以 7，即 INT4 能够表示的最大数值，得到该行的缩放因子。随后，将每一行除以其对应的缩放因子，并将结果舍入至最近的整数。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub3ba6247" id="ub3ba6247"><span data-lake-id="uf53f8afa" id="uf53f8afa">反量化时，将通用矩阵乘法（GEMM）的 INT32 输出转换为 FP16，再乘以对应行的缩放因子和对应列的缩放因子；前者来自输入的缩放因子，后者来自权重的缩放因子。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="hv1En" id="hv1En"><span data-lake-id="u13769cbd" id="u13769cbd">阶段 2c：量化注意力</span></h3><p data-lake-id="u2905732b" id="u2905732b"><span data-lake-id="uf7ada6b9" id="uf7ada6b9">当序列较长、批量大小较大时，注意力计算明显受限于内存访问。对键和值进行旋转后，可以有效地将缓存量化为低位宽表示，从而减少所需的输入／输出（IO）操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf37816f3" id="uf37816f3"><span data-lake-id="u6ac72555" id="u6ac72555">将查询保留为 FP16，并采用类似 FlashAttention [Dao et al., 2022] 的在线 softmax 计算方式。从内存中加载一段 KV 向量后，先执行反量化，再以 FP16 计算点积。</span></p>